        google: { rating: 4.9, review_count: 123, maps_url: 'https://maps.google.com/?cid=6099604390431392281&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA', reviews: [{author: 'Racheal Allison', rating: 5, text: 'Love this place. Stopped in this morning to check out new full potency products and left a very happy customer! Good people, good vibes and good local products! Thanks so much for being you, guys ❤️', time: '4 months ago'}, {author: 'Karina Lennox', rating: 5, text: 'Love this place! Stopped in over the weekend to try some product & the staff were so friendly, knowledgeable, & so willing to help you pick out the right products for yourself. It’s so exciting having a dispensary in town & this place went above & beyond my expectations. Prices are imo decent & the product is of great quality. Can’t wait to see what product they get in over the months as they cont', time: '4 months ago'}, {author: 'Brittney Carroll', rating: 5, text: 'Amazing products, and even better people. Honest, respectful, and welcoming vibe. Chris and Alex genuinely care about their customers, and would be happy to answer any questions. I look forward to seeing their business continue to thrive 💚', time: '4 months ago'}, {author: 'Cole Norby', rating: 5, text: 'First off — WOW!!!!  Chris and Alex are beyond fantastic. Those two guys have great energy!! I walked in for the first time after seeing they opened up, and wasn’t sure what to expect.  Blew my expectations away. Open to answering all questions, EXTREMELY knowledgeable — and are straight to the point and make it super chill and easygoing. Very welcoming enviorment.  Product availability is great. ', time: '5 months ago'}, {author: 'Alex Zapata', rating: 5, text: 'Great customer service! Quality shop and product, Two brothers who care about their customers and are fair! Couldn’t recommend any more!', time: '5 months ago'}] }
