        google: { rating: 5, review_count: 21, maps_url: 'https://maps.google.com/?cid=8119976340963976275&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA', reviews: [{author: 'Jacki Roubik', rating: 5, text: 'I use the suave on my neck,.works fantastic, relaxes my nerves in my neck witch I normally get saveer migraine. and it\'s natural.  Where prescription patches rubs pills are so hard on your colon stomach and  skin. .  I do still take a low dose of pills  but I swear by it..', time: 'a year ago'}, {author: 'Katrina Miller', rating: 5, text: 'I love this business. The owners are extremely knowledgeable. I adore their line of skincare products. Their facewash is so gentle. Their Vitamin C cream is so soothing and moisturizing. And the cherry chapstick is amazing! I highly recommend this place.', time: '2 years ago'}, {author: 'Rachel', rating: 5, text: 'Always a great experience here! Knowledgeable owners/staff who always are eager to answer questions and explain products uses without making one feel silly. Knowing it all is locally grown and meticulously inspected is something you rarely find; check out their facial line as well!! Great prices and a cute storefront; truly something for everyone and maybe you\'ll learn a thing or 2!!', time: '2 years ago'}, {author: 'laura stern', rating: 5, text: 'Wonderful customer service! I struggle with chronic pain, extreme anxiety, PTSD, migraines, and trouble with sleep. I’ve tried multiple different CBD oil brands, this is the only brand that actually helped calm me enough to sleep. It has become a necessity in my sleep routine! Not to mention the pets CBD oil helped my little dog lucky with pain when he was passing. His end of life was much more co', time: '2 years ago'}, {author: 'Cheyenne Laux', rating: 5, text: 'We love love LOVED this place! Brought the whole family here on our visit through Minnesota and they were so nice and knowledgeable.  It really seemed like they had everything. From beautiful local treasures to the perfect cbd treatments that helped alleviate my soar muscles during our trip.  There\'s even thc/cbd sparkling water drinks that my wife fell in love with!  They were so professional in ', time: '2 years ago'}] }
