        google: { rating: 4.5, review_count: 1239, maps_url: 'https://maps.google.com/?cid=6125327960312944220&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA', reviews: [{author: 'Krista Ritzer', rating: 5, text: 'Rythm is the best flower I\'ve found in Minnesota so far. The staff here was knowledgeable and friendly. Such a great vibe. I will be back to RISE Eagan again. Getting a med card was a no brainer for buying cannabis at a dispensary.', time: '4 months ago'}, {author: 'Suzi Higgles', rating: 5, text: 'I had a great experience.  I was in and out in less than 10 mins. Joss was such a burst of sunshine. She made me feel like I was a Boss Queen, which I am. I would go back there just to have her upsell me again.', time: '7 months ago'}, {author: 'Adham Younis', rating: 5, text: 'I had an incredible visit at Rise Dispensary in Eagan today! From the moment I walked in, the staff was so welcoming, friendly, and knowledgeable. The atmosphere was relaxed, and everything was clean and well-organized.  A huge shoutout to Bianca, the manager, who went above and beyond to make sure I had a great experience. Her professionalism, warmth, and expertise truly stood out.  Highly recomm', time: '10 months ago'}, {author: 'Molly Price', rating: 5, text: 'I just had my first experience at Rise in Eagan and it was excellent! All of the staff were super friendly and welcoming. I waited in a short line to get checked in, and once my ID was checked I walked in, put my order in via the kiosk, and checked out. In total it took me about 20 minutes! Highly recommend to anyone looking for quality products and top notch service. Brittany helped check me out ', time: '6 months ago'}, {author: 'Midnight Lupine', rating: 5, text: 'The staff were amazing! This was my first time in a dispensary as I just received my medical card and they were so kind through the whole process! There was a system issue with my pharmacy appointment but they resolved it and I was able to pick up my prescription no problem! James and an employee whose name I sadly did not receive (tall guy, medium length hair, blonde) were incredibly kind, knowle', time: '5 months ago'}] }
